  "description": "Anfar 1950 Pistachio Kunafa is a sweet, creamy, nutty gourmand fragrance inspired by the iconic Middle Eastern dessert. It is rich, edible, and ultra comforting — a dream scent for lovers of pistachio, vanilla, and warm pastry notes. It opens with sweet pistachio cream, caramel drizzle, and toasted nuts, giving an immediate dessert-like warmth. The heart reveals whipped vanilla, soft florals, and buttered pastry nuances, creating a smooth, velvety, melt-in-your-skin aroma. The base settles into amber, sugar syrup, creamy musk, and warm woods, offering a long-lasting, cozy, mouthwatering trail. Perfect for customers who love gourmand fragrances in the style of pistachio gelato, vanilla desserts, caramel pastries, and sweet creamy scents.",
